    "text": "\u00d0is is \u00fe\u00e6ra ger\u00e6dnessa sum \u00fee bisceopas ger\u00e6d habba\u00f0 heom sylfum to \u00feearfe.\n\u00c6rest \u00fe\u00e6t hy ealle anr\u00e6de beon & an lufian for gode & for worulde, & \u00fe\u00e6t hy beon swa hym to gebyre\u00f0\n& hy ger\u00e6ddon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6t \u00e6fre \u00e6lcere m\u00e6ssan \u00fee heora \u00e6nig sylf gem\u00e6ssige gemune mid \u00ferim collectum\n& begyte heora \u00e6ghwylc \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00e6fre \u00e6ghwylcere wucan for ealle geferan ane sunderm\u00e6ssan\n& \u00feonne hwylcum bisceope for\u00f0si\u00f0 gebyrige, \u00feonne singe \u00e6lc bisceop sylf \u00fereo m\u00e6ssan for \u00fea sawle\n& gefreoge anne man for \u00fea sawle, & anne \u00feearfan fede XXX daga.\n& \u00e6t \u00feam \u00feritige\u00fean d\u00e6ge geba\u00f0ige swa feala \u00feearfena swa he m\u00e6st m\u00e6ge & \u00feam do eallum \u00e6t &\nSe \u00fee \u00feas ger\u00e6dnesse mid gode geyce, god hyt him geleanige swa him leofost sy, amen.\nWe greta\u00f0 eac ealle ure gebro\u00fera & geswustra \u00fee abbudhades syn & abbudyssan swy\u00fee bli\u00feelice, & hy\n& we gyrna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi us on heora gebedr\u00e6dene mid heora gebro\u00f0ra & geswustra fultume synderlice eac\nAc \u00fe\u00e6re gebedr\u00e6dene we wilnia\u00f0 georne \u00fe\u00e6t hi for us beon ge on life ge on legere & we ea\u00femodlice\nEala leofan gebro\u00f0ru & geswustra, ge\u00feenca\u00f0 swy\u00fee georne \u00fea oferneode \u00fee us eallum ys gem\u00e6ne.\nGod us gehealde for hys micelan mildheortnysse & us gescylde \u00fe\u00e6t we n\u00e6fre ne forwur\u00f0on on \u00f0am\nAMHN.",
